<title>USA: Phillips-Van Heusen Q3 shr profit.</title>
<headline>Phillips-Van Heusen Q3 shr profit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr    profit   $0.56	    loss  $0.16</p>
<p> Net    profit   15,035	   loss  4,374</p>
<p> Sales	     391,245		  448,007</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  27,005		   26,762</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr    profit   $0.39	    loss  $0.14</p>
<p> Net    profit   10,607	   loss  3,840</p>
<p> Sales	     978,712		  1,080,487</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  26,994		   26,693</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Phillips-Van Heusen Corp</p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding the non-recurring $25 million charge in 1995, earnings per share in 3Q95 and the first nine months 1995 were $0.43 and $0.45, respectively. The company said it had expected a 3Q96 sales decline given an absence of clearance sales associated with the acquisition of Crystal Brands, the planned elimination of the company's private label retail formats, reduction of low margin private label sales at the wholesale level and closure of factory outlet stores.</p>
</text>
